WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.714
Open the PDF you want to edit.

2
00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:07.840
Pick the page with the text you want to change.

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.240
Click Edit text.

4
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.510
Then click the line you want to change.

5
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:17.920
Type the new text, and press Enter. It keeps the PDF's own font.

6
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.500
To move a paragraph, click Move text.

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.430
Click the paragraph you want to move.

8
00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.660
Drag it to its new place, even onto another page.

9
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:32.146
Finally, click Save PDF. Your edited copy is saved on your device.

10
00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:35.832
The rest of the page stays exactly as it was.
